MODIFICATIONS IN THIS PACKAGE (2.0.0, 2026-11-16)
-------------------------------------------------
This distribution ("ArcGIS Pro MCP 优化版 / AgentKit 2.0.0") conveys, together
with the add-in binary, a corresponding source snapshot and the following
additions by the package maintainers:
  - PowerShell stdio bridge, RunCode toolbox runtime, installers, self-check
    and documentation;
  - on-demand dialog guard: new `guard.ps1` engine, rules schema, Python CLI,
    add-in `GuardClient` auto-summon, `guard_summon` / `guard_status` tools;
  - on-demand template distillation: `arcgis-distill` pipeline, schema v1.1,
    template library and `template_*` MCP tools;
  - local patches carried from upstream 1.1.1 to 1.1.4 (activate_map deadlock
    fix, three-lane JobScheduler, get_queue_status) and 2.0.0 version
    normalization.
See CHANGELOG.md, docs/guard.md, docs/distill.md and the source snapshot's
SOURCE-NOTICE/upstream-CHANGELOG for details.

